${__seed_comment}

Every space our community runs, online and in person, is meant to be welcoming
and harassment-free for everyone, regardless of experience, background or
identity.

## Reporting

If you experience or witness a breach of this code, contact **${coc_contact}**.
Reports are handled discreetly.

## Adopt an established code

This page is a starting point. We recommend adopting an established code of
conduct, such as the Contributor Covenant or the PSF Code of Conduct, rather
than writing your own, and linking its full text here.
